          "quote": "立刻按铃，不等"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "Concrete new postoperative urinary symptoms appeared and the doctor explicitly reprioritized to immediate nursing assessment, with a backup pathway and rationale. Although this occurred after the original preoperative phase, it was a real dynamic reprioritization with meaningful trajectory impact.",
