          "explanation": "The doctor confirmed discharge medication, pathology, red flags, and family communication.",
          "quote": "您这五条理解都对"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly checked and reinforced patient/family receipt of the plan, including results, medication boundaries, symptom escalation, and responsible services.",
